// CHECK: [MLInlineAdvisor] Nodes: 4 Edges: 5 EdgesOfLastSeenNodes: 4
// CHECK: [MLInlineAdvisor] Nodes: 4 Edges: 5 EdgesOfLastSeenNodes: 4
// CHECK: [MLInlineAdvisor] Nodes: 4 Edges: 5 EdgesOfLastSeenNodes: 4
// CHECK: [MLInlineAdvisor] Nodes: 4 Edges: 5 EdgesOfLastSeenNodes: 1
